<title>MEXICO: Grupo Financiero Banorte 9-mth net rises.</title>
<headline>Grupo Financiero Banorte 9-mth net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Share	     0.59		     0.46</p>
<p> Oper Income     n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p> Net		 272.3 million	  n.a.</p>
<p> Revs		n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Grupo Financiero Banorte SA de CV. The company said its nine-month net profit was up 28 percent from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>It also said its capitalisation ratio at the end of September was 20.1 percent compared to 11.4 percent at the end of the third quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 7289500</p>
